        <mxCell id="400" value="&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;Legend&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;• Public subnets: ALB + NAT (single NAT in AZ-a)&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;• Private subnets: ECS Fargate (no public IP)&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;• ECS → NAT → AWS APIs (DDB, Secrets, ECR, CloudWatch)&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;• Route53 health checks on /health" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F3;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="1500" width="520" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>